- Real-Deck rows (Game Mode, built-in controls, arm''s-length reading, suspend/resume, Proton): not in S3; plan 90 (milestone 10) has them. If listed for orientation, they are "skipped: no Deck (decision 125)", never failed.
- Family check (once, not per platform): `trivia-desktop` with the save imported by plan 99 (its decision "Family save imported into trivia-desktop?") shows the family''s players and seen counters; one round in each mode («Solo o en grupo», «Modo anfitrión») Player → Choice → Bundles (Colombia''s bundle first with its flag on the family''s machine if its region is `CO`; base bundle preset on; supply report there), pad only, on the TV.

## Tasks
