3. **Delete the Python referee** (needs plan 50 closed with the test night "fine", and tasks 1–2): delete `game.py`, `selection.py`, `flags.py`, `record_fixtures.py`; routes out of `main.py`; `categories.py` moved; `save.py` `_upgrade`; `save_file.py` without fallback; `apply_flags` without `flags.json`; fixtures README frozen. Checks: `grep -rn "import game\|import selection\|import flags\|from selection\|from game" app authoring` empty; server on temp `TRIVIA_STATE`: `/`, `/data/pool.json`, `/api/save` GET/PUT, a cached `/media` work, `/api/game`, `/api/players`, `/api/flags`, `/api/categories` → 404; plan 49''s migration cases (a)–(c) still pass with `_upgrade` (throw-away, source DB byte-identical); a short game in the browser or via `lib/api.ts` under `node` with the `fetch` shim (plan 50 task 2''s script) still plays. `npm test` (fixtures still replay), `npm run check`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate`, `qgen report`, `trivia-authoring` start page, `/review` with a flag in `game.json` turning into a review once.
4. **Decision entry, docs, package check** (needs task 3): the decision entry; every doc in "Files"; `main.py` docstring lists exactly the final routes. `nix build .#app` (update `npmDepsHash` only if the lockfile changed), then `result/bin/trivia` with temp `TRIVIA_STATE` and `TRIVIA_MEDIA=$PWD/media`: serves `/`, `/data/pool.json`, `/api/save`, one cached `/media`; `result/share/trivia/app/server/` holds no `game.py`, `selection.py`, `flags.py`, `categories.py` and no download code. `grep -rn "game\.py\|selection\.py\|/api/game\|/api/players\|/api/flags\|/api/categories" --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=dist .` hits only history (decisions, done plan notes, fixtures README). Mark PORT-8 `[x]` in `plans/12-client-engine.md` with date and files.

