   - `README.md`: "Status" says the game is released on Steam (the Steam build is the only game, decision 111); "How to …", commands only, one entry each, merged with what earlier plans wrote (no duplicates):
     - "Cut a release": bump `version` in `app/desktop/package.json`, `qgen validate`, commit, `git tag v<x>`, `trivia-steam upload --branch beta`, `trivia-release-check --manual FILE`, then the Steamworks steps by hand: link `plans/11-steam.md` "Release checklist (ST-4)" and "Launch (S6)"
