   - Milestone check: in the task note cite the answered "Released? date, build id" and "Content patch v<x> live? …" decisions (ids, dates, version, BuildID) and the released candidate''s ST-4 decision (id; `report` and `offline` rows passed). If one isn''t answered, don''t close: `pm task-pending-decision` on it, stage what''s done, stop. If the released build''s `report` or `offline` row didn''t pass, don''t close: a task in plan 93 or 103 (per ST-4''s `failed` routing), stop.
