   - `plans/18-steam-integration.md` SW-6 step list (the `report` step); `AGENTS.md` "Commands" `trivia-release-check` line (`report` step); README "Upload to Steam" only if it lists steps.
   - Check: `trivia-release-check --skip tag --skip checks --skip licenses --skip quality --skip nix --skip desktop --skip credits --skip smoke --skip manual` against `trivia-report-server dev` (URL via a throw-away build config or plan 93''s dev override) → `report` ✓; server stopped → ✗ with the URL named; empty URL → ✗ "no report URL"; a `--manual` file answering every row incl. `report` parses; a content-only run lists `report` as "skipped: content-only since <tag>". `grep -rn "Steam not running" authoring plans` finds nothing.

## Done when
