INSERT INTO plan (id, milestone_id, subject, priority, body, intro, created_at, created_by_task) VALUES (122, 15, 'Modding end-to-end check and close-out', 150, 'Part 12 of masterplan 102 (milestone 15: Modding and Steam Workshop), last: proves the milestone''s "Done when" and closes it. The gamemaster publishes the four example mods with the game''s own command and loads them from the Workshop on a second Steam account, through one checklist decision; a second decision confirms the guide link on the store page; the release check gets a mods step and a Workshop row (a task in plan 104) so modding stays tested in every release; a docs pass makes the plan files, README and AGENTS.md match what was built. Workers never log in, upload or edit Steamworks; they write the checklists against the code as built and act on the answers.

