   - Slug keys: `qgen validate` passes the slug rules (slug form, unique per bundle, every names file complete) for `base`, `colombia` and every other bundle; `rg` finds no Spanish name used as a key in `authoring/data/` (questions'' `subcategory`, `targets.json`, concept file names) or `app/data/`; `categories.json` holds no display names; `app/data/` names files for `en`, `es`, `de` (+ `es-ES` overrides); `modding/` kit documents slugs + names as optional and `trivia-desktop --check-mod` passes on a shipped example in today''s plain-string format. A miss → `pm task add <slug-keys plan>` with the finding, stop.
