     - the same family-save copy: `purged`, `swapped_to`, `notified_exhausted` with old keys (Spanish names, old category slugs) map on load; category names on Configure and in the game the same as before (D-59); `en` and `de` saves show the `names.<locale>.json` names, not slugs.
     - keyboard only and pad (if the dev server''s pad emulation exists; else keyboard only, noted).
