- `BundleSelector.svelte`: tile by `kind`: `base` `book`, `region` `pin`, mod bundle (`source: "mod"`) `puzzle`
- `screens/Mods.svelte`: refresh `refresh`, all off `power`, restart `rocket`, back `back`; mod rows `puzzle`
