- Real App ID first: `plan 130: Steamworks app configuration (SW-7)`, `decision 179: Steamworks app configured (SW-7)? IDs?` and `task 1045: Real App ID in the repo and SW-7 close-out`; Spacewar 480 is no test (Remote Play Together settings are per app)
- `beta` build: `plan 89: Builds, depots and upload (SW-10, SW-6)` (`trivia-steam upload --branch beta`, first upload `task 681: First beta upload: checklist and decision`); nothing here uploads
