INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (49, 16, 'authoring/QC.md, RUNBOOK/AGENTS/directory pointers; per-batch pattern for plan 17', 'work', 'done', 620, '2026-10-11, authoring/QC.md (new), RUNBOOK step 5, AGENTS.md, directory.md; D-56 matches; plan 17 already has the pattern (task 53), unchanged', 'Part "Findings → changes (c)" of plan 16, the written procedure.

- `authoring/QC.md` (new): steps 1–5 of plan 16 (batch done → blind spot check by the gamemaster, a pm decision "Spot check <batch> done?" for workers → `qgen report --qc <batch>` → proposals by the threshold rule into one pm decision "QC <batch>: which changes?" → approved ones become implementation tasks; next batch waits on both decisions). Prompt changes never inside a batch run.
