INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (53, 17, 'QC batch-8', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-15, authoring/reports/batch-8.md (QC section, Changes 1182, 1183), authoring/data/questions.json, app/data/pool.json (rework-3). Decisions: 215 spot check done (26/30 agree, 87 % < 90 %, release bar ✗); 226 → all: task 1182 (QC batch-8 A, ambiguity) and task 1183 (QC batch-8 B, regional premise), in plan 17 at priority 650 because plan 16 is closed. Approved/target base: d1 46/250, d2 109/350, d3 143/450, d4 156/450, d5 174/450, d6 218/450, d7 176/450, d8 164/450, d9 161/330, d10 158/330, d11 156/330, d12 143/230, d13 137/230, d14 69/125, d15 17/125; total 2027/5000 (before rework). batch-8 needs_work at record 45/992 (4.5 %): media 2.1 %, giveaway 1.4 %, fact 0.6 %, overlap 0.4 %, other 0. Media yield 2.1 % (batch-7 7.0 %): under 10 %, but the top reason → task 1184: write plan: media yield. Rework (decision 3, plain qgen rework, rework-3): needs_work 31 → 13 (batch-4 1→1, batch-5 1→0, batch-6 2→2, batch-7 13→2, batch-8 14→8), 18 approved, $3.57. Targets not met → task 1185: run batch-9, task 1186: QC batch-9. batch-8 Health ✗ (overlap rate 5.5 %, gap 11–15): batch-9 may stop at exit 2 for qgen health ack. Missing tooling: none.', 'QC of batch-8 per `authoring/QC.md` (plan 16) and plan 17 "Per-batch pattern" 2. Runs after `task 1129: Finish batch-8 after task 1128: Fix qgen media: Commons extmetadata [] crashes the search`; if batch-8 isn''t finished (no `authoring/reports/batch-8.md`), stop without changes (the run order should prevent it).

Phases (the task runs again after each decision is answered; check which decisions exist with `pm show`):
1. `pm decision add "Spot check batch-8 done?"` (body: `/review?batch=batch-8&sample=1` link, size, how to start `trivia-authoring`; option "done"), wait on it, stop.
2. `qgen report --qc batch-8`; proposals by QC.md''s threshold rule into `pm decision add "QC batch-8: which changes?"` (options: recommended set / all / none); wait on it, stop. No proposals: skip the decision.
3. Approved proposals → tasks in plans 13–16 (`pm task add <plan>`, their priority). Record in the note: approved/target per difficulty (`qgen report`), needs_work by reason, media yield (no-media needs_work / merged).
4. needs_work per `decision 3: How are needs_work questions (33 now, more per batch) resolved?` (rework once after each batch''s QC): plain `qgen rework` (no `--batch`: this once it also covers the backlog of batch-7 and older, 34 at 2026-10-15, which `task 52: needs_work of batch-7/8 per decision 3` was to do); exit codes as RUNBOOK step 3 / "Under `pm run`"; stage the printed paths. Note: needs_work count by batch before/after. Then `pm decision consequences 3 "<text>"` (task 52 dropped into this one; later QC tasks run `qgen rework --batch batch-<n>`).
5. Media yield ≥ 10% here and in batch-7, or the top needs_work reason: `pm task add 1 "write plan: media yield" --kind plan` pointing to `plans/06-images.md`, `plans/23-media-providers.md`, IMG-16/17; only if no such task exists.
6. Next: if plan 12''s targets are met (or the next batch would overshoot every remaining gap): add the exit-check task (plan 17 "Exit check"). Else add `run batch-9` and `QC batch-9` with bodies like this pair''s; QC batch-9''s needs_work step: `qgen rework --batch batch-9`.

Missing tooling (audit, `--qc`, spot-check page): do what exists, list the rest in the note. No prompt or `qgen.py` changes here.

Done when: phase 6 done; note lists decisions, change tasks, numbers.', '2026-10-11T23:54:42Z', '2026-10-15T21:52:26Z', 24, 0, NULL, NULL);
