- Throw-away script: for every level 1–12 and seeds 0–5, old `milestone()`/`consolation()` (from `git show HEAD:…`) and new return the same string.', '2026-10-12T00:14:29Z', '2026-10-12T04:52:21Z', 86, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (92, 21, 'LUI-1: sound cues to neutral ids', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-11, app/client/src/game/sound.svelte.ts (Cue union, SAMPLE_FOR/RECIPES as Record by cue, sfx(cue, level)), Game/Question/Shredder/Fireworks.svelte call sites. Check: throw-away script resolved every old call string (47 incl. each joker label, bloque 1/6/12, go() effects) through the old regex tables at HEAD and each cue through the new tables: same sample and same recipe body for all. Merged: candado clunk/se cierra→padlock-close, trombón/¡Ups!→sad-trombone, escoba/swoosh→swoosh, listo/¡hola!→ready, golpe: respuesta final/boom→boom, comodín: <label>→joker-activate.', '`sfx()` stops matching Spanish descriptions by regex; it takes a typed cue id. Plan 21 «Design», sound cues.

- `app/client/src/game/sound.svelte.ts`: `type Cue` = union of neutral ids (`"applause"`, `"applause-big"`, `"sad-trombone"`, `"padlock-close"`, `"menu-open"`, `"joker-armed"`, …, one per distinct sound today); `SAMPLE_FOR`, `RECIPES` become lookups by cue id. Level thud: typed level argument (`sfx("block", { level })` or `` `block-${n}` ``). Sample file names in `public/audio/` stay.
- Every call site (`grep -rn "sfx(" app/client/src`; today ~30 in `Game.svelte`, `Question.svelte`, `Shredder.svelte`, `Fireworks.svelte`) switches to cue ids.
