Done when: `npm run check` and `npm run build` pass; `es` output unchanged; quick `?lang=en` look at select and question screens shows the new names without overflow (overflow → `plans/backlog.md`, origin `LUI-3`).', '2026-10-12T00:16:05Z', '2026-10-12T23:28:15Z', 89, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (105, 25, 'record the gamemaster''s check of the colombia proposals (D-39)', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-13, plans/22-bundles.md, plans/project.md', 'Waits on the decision "Have you checked the colombia proposals at /review?bundle=colombia?" (created by task 90, linked to this task). Do nothing before it is answered.

After the answer:
- Count the 84 `colombia` proposals in `work/bundles/proposals.json`: still `colombia` vs. moved to `base` in `authoring/data/questions.json`. If the answer lists ids to move instead, move them with the review server''s bundle API (`trivia-authoring`) or tell the gamemaster; never edit the pool by hand (AGENTS.md).
- `qgen validate` (also confirms every question has `bundle`). A moved question whose subcategory isn''t in `base` (D-49): log it in `plans/backlog.md` or `plans/open-questions.md`, leave the fix to the gamemaster.
- `qgen export` so `app/data/pool.json` is current.
- `plans/22-bundles.md`: BN-3 line gets date and kept/moved counts.
- `plans/project.md`: M3 line "Gamemaster checks the 84 `colombia` proposals" → `[x]`; bundle counts under State (Bundles line).

Done when: notes in `22-bundles.md` and `project.md`; `qgen validate` passes; `app/data/pool.json` fresh.', '2026-10-12T00:16:29Z', '2026-10-13T06:23:07Z', 90, 0, NULL, NULL);
