INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (140, 31, 'UI-7: preload Question media before the fade-in', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, app/client/src/game/{Game.svelte,Question.svelte,timing.ts}: Question exports ready() (picture onload, audio/video canplaythrough with preload=auto, any error ends the wait) and takes shown={!black}; media starts when shown and the overlay is closed (no autoplay); go() waits max PRELOAD_MAX_MS=2000 on the question screen; local state ready renamed finalReady; PLACEHOLDER(UI-7) removed. Not tested in a throttled browser yet', '`go()` in `app/client/src/game/Game.svelte` waits for the next Question''s media before fading in, at most 2 s; video/audio no longer play behind the black. Shape: plan 31, "Shape (decided here)".

- `Question.svelte`: export `ready(): Promise<void>`; resolves on picture decoded (`onload` / `img.decode()`), video/audio `canplaythrough`, or any failure (`onerror`, `mediaFailed`); text question → resolves at once.
- Drop `autoplay` on `<video>`/`<audio>` (~lines 367, 386); export `start()` (or a `shown` prop, your pick) that `go()` calls when `black = false`.
- Paths not through `go()` (page reload on a running game, `{#key game.question.id}` swaps by Bájale/Cambiazo): media still starts by itself, no waiting.
- `pausedMedia` (overlay pause) and `replay()` keep working with the deferred start.
- `go()`: after `screen = next`, `await tick()`, then `Promise.race([questionRef?.ready() ?? Promise.resolve(), sleep(PRELOAD_MAX_MS)])`, then fade in as today. Other screens: no wait.
- `timing.ts`: `PRELOAD_MAX_MS = 2000`, one-line comment.
- Remove the `PLACEHOLDER(UI-7)` comment (Game.svelte ~117).
- No new dependencies.

Done when:
- `npm run check`, `npm run build` pass.
- Dev browser, DevTools "Slow 4G", large video/image: fade waits for the media, never > 2 s; video/audio start with the fade-in.
- `/media` 404: fade in after ≤ 2 s, «medio no disponible» notice shows.
- Text questions and media-free screens fade in as fast as today.', '2026-10-12T00:35:30Z', '2026-10-12T05:27:47Z', 137, 0, NULL, NULL);
