INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (231, 46, 'Screen check at 1280×800, 1280×720 and 4K, fixes (SW-4)', 'work', 'done', 370, '2026-10-12, app/client/src/game/{Choice,Glyph,Question,SupplyReport}.svelte, plans/{04,10,14,18,project}.md. Throw-away Playwright walk (decision 6) of 33 states (Start, Player empty/9×30-char names/delete/letter picker, Choice incl. 11-levels-short supply report in both modes, Start supply, Level, Select with longest description, Question long/worst-case content/locked/armed/Soplo/Paso/Francotirador/Cambiazo both steps/video/audio/medio no disponible, Correct, Wrong, Victory, overlay gamemaster + standard, report list, Credits, error box) at 1280x800, 1280x720, 1920x1080, 3840x2160, keyboard prompts and faked Xbox pad. Findings → fixes: credit 0.8→0.9u (8.5px); pad glyph labels LB/RB/LT/RT 7.1px → 9.2px at 1280 (13.5 viewBox units, attribute, no px); media-missing chip rem → --u; Choice with a long supply report overflowed top and bottom at 720p AND 1080p → report in 4 columns when >4 levels short, Choice gap 0.8u while reporting. Small-text report empty; nothing clipped/offscreen. Safe-area exception for the credit line and the bottom of «Respuesta final» (decision 52, recorded). 1080p compare before/after: diffs only at credit, supply report, pad glyph labels, plus fireworks noise. 4K sharp. For plan 48 on a real Deck (Linux build, Game Mode, built-in controls only): text readable at arm''s length on Question (credit line, «Elijan una respuesta», hint notes), LB/RB/LT/RT glyph labels, Cambiazo subcategory tiles, overlay debug lines; letter picker end to end (A types, B deletes/closes, Start closes, Listo plays); D-pad/stick focus on Choice and overlay; nothing cut at the 16:10 edges; Steam Input shows Xbox glyphs.', 'Task 2 of plan 46 ("Size rule", "Check sizes", "What to look for", "Screens and states", "Screenshots" in Design). 