- `passed`: done.
- `passed with minor issues`: each issue into `plans/backlog.md` with the owning plan file''s task ID prefix (SW-, IN-, PUB-, UI-); done.
- `failed`: per failing row `pm task add <owning plan>` (54 shell, 55 saves, 56 builds, 44–47 input/Deck/credits, 65 seen counters, 99 family save and retirement, 113 image peek, 151 bundle flow, layout and combinations, 156 prompts following the last input) with the row, the note and how to reproduce, at that plan''s priority (no `--priority`). Then `did=$(pm decision add "S3 re-test passed?" --intro … …)` with only the failed rows plus the full-game row, same options; `pm task-pending-decision` for 236 and 237 on it; stage and stop without closing. Repeat until passed.
