- `main.mjs`: privileged `app` scheme, `protocol.handle("app")`, window loads `app://trivia/`; `roots()` (dev paths, `app.isPackaged` → `process.resourcesPath`); missing `dist/index.html` → dialog «client not built: run `npm run build -w app/client`» and quit; fullscreen, `show: false` until `ready-to-show`, theme background, no menu, F11 via `before-input-event`, single-instance lock, `autoplay-policy` switch; `contextIsolation`, `sandbox`, no `nodeIntegration`, `will-navigate`/window-open blocked, `http(s)`/`ws(s)` cancelled, permissions denied except `fullscreen`, DevTools only with `TRIVIA_DEVTOOLS=1`.
- `flake.nix`: `pkgs.electron` in the dev shell; `trivia-desktop` (`writeShellApplication`, `electron "$root/app/desktop" "$@"`, `fromCheckout`-style). No `.#app` change.

Done when (throw-away CDP script via `--remote-debugging-port` and Node''s `WebSocket`, `xvfb-run` if no display): `npm run build -w app/client`; `trivia-desktop` opens fullscreen, start screen renders with both fonts (`document.fonts`); `fetch("/audio/fanfarria.m4a")` 200 `audio/mp4`; `fetch("https://example.org")` fails; `window.require` undefined; F11 toggles fullscreen; without `dist/` the dialog appears. `trivia` unchanged; `nix develop -c true` evaluates. Note SW-2 progress in `plans/18-steam-integration.md` (not `[x]` yet).', '2026-10-12T03:38:12Z', '2026-10-12T14:36:30Z', 313, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (315, 54, 'Desktop shell: /data and /media resolver with ranges', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, app/desktop/resolve.mjs (/data/, /media?url= from pool URLs with cache_path names, media_missing, single Range → 206/416, streamed bodies; main.mjs already passes data/media roots), plans/18 SW-2 progress. Checked with a throw-away node script: cache_path parity with python3 for all 1102 pool URLs; cached webm 200 video/webm byte-equal; bytes=0-99 → 206, 100 bytes, Content-Range ok; uncached → media_missing; non-pool, ..%2f and %2e%2e%2f escapes → 404; /data/../ and /data/%2e%2e/ are folded by the URL parser before the resolver and land on the SPA index.html, never on /data/; /data/ files incl. bundles/colombia/categories.json byte-equal. In the window (xvfb, CDP): Apollo 11 webm seeks to 5 s, seeked fires.', 'Part 2 of plan 54 (SW-2): `app/desktop/resolve.mjs` answers `/data/…` and `/media?url=…` as the Python server does, plus `Range`. Needs task 297 (`/data/` URLs, `lib/data.ts`); if it isn''t done, stop and say so.

- `/data/<path>` → file under `data` (resolve + containment, like `send_static`), else `404 {"error":"not_found"}`.
- `/media?url=<file_url>`: only URLs in `data/pool.json` (`picked`: `media.file_url`, `background.file_url`; set computed once) → `<media>/<sha1(url)[:16]><ext>`, same rule as `app/server/media_cache.py` `cache_path` (lowercase ext matching `\.[a-z0-9]{1,5}`, else `.bin`; `node:crypto`). Missing file → `404 {"error":"media_missing"}`; not in pool → `404 {"error":"not_found"}`. No network.
- `Range` → `206` with `Content-Range` (own implementation, not `net.fetch(file:)`).
- `main.mjs` passes the `data` and `media` roots.

Done when (throw-away `node` script against `makeResolver`, temp media dir): `cache_path` parity with `python3` `media_cache.cache_path` for every URL in `app/data/pool.json`; cached file 200 with right MIME and bytes; `Range: bytes=0-99` → 206, 100 bytes, correct `Content-Range`; uncached pool URL → `media_missing`; non-pool URL, `/data/../client/dist/index.html`, `/data/%2e%2e/…` → 404; `/data/pool.json` and every categories file byte-equal. In the window (CDP): a video question seeks (`currentTime` set, `seeked` fires).', '2026-10-12T03:38:12Z', '2026-10-12T14:38:30Z', 313, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (316, 54, 'Desktop shell: preload bridge and client adapter', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, app/desktop/preload.cjs (window.trivia: desktop, toggleFullscreen, quit), app/desktop/main.mjs (preload, ipcMain handlers with app://trivia/ origin check), app/client/src/lib/desktop.ts, app/client/src/lib/engine.ts (MemoryStore when desktop), app/client/src/game/Overlay.svelte (bridge fullscreen, «Salir del juego» via t(''overlay.quit''), authoring links hidden), locales/es.ts. CDP: keys exact, fullscreen flips, quit/«Salir» exit 0; browser overlay unchanged (headless Chrome, temp TRIVIA_STATE); check, build, check:literals pass', 'Part 3 of plan 54 (SW-2): the bridge `window.trivia` and the client changes that use it, only when it is present (D-59: browser game unchanged). Needs plan 49 task 294 (`MemoryStore`); if it isn''t done, stop and say so. The store line needs task 298 (`lib/engine.ts`); if 298 isn''t done, leave a plain TODO for the plan''s last task (no `PLACEHOLDER`) and say so in the note.

