Done when: in `trivia-desktop` (CDP) `window.trivia.desktop === true`, its keys are exactly `desktop`, `toggleFullscreen`, `quit`; `toggleFullscreen()` flips `isFullScreen`; `quit()` exits with code 0. In the browser (`trivia`, temp `TRIVIA_STATE`) the overlay looks and behaves as before (no «Salir», authoring links, DOM fullscreen). `npm run check`, `npm run build` pass.', '2026-10-12T03:38:12Z', '2026-10-12T14:41:30Z', 313, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (317, 54, 'Steam binding: facts and decision', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, pm decision 28 (Steam binding), follow-up task 353 pending on it; no files', 'Second half of SW-2 (plan 54 "Steam binding pick"): no code, no dependency. Compare steamworks-ffi-node and steamworks.js, with sources and dates:

