INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (345, 58, 'Fable rework experiment: run, compare with rework-1, keep/drop/extend decision', 'work', 'done', -100, '2026-10-15, authoring/data/questions.json, app/data/pool.json (rework-2 with fable: 52/79 approved, $20.08); plan 58 Result section; decision 216 raised', 'Plan 58 "The experiment". Needs the `--model` flag (task above). Waits for the gamemaster''s go (AGENTS.md: `qgen rework` only on the gamemaster''s word).
