rt overlay, B closes it, View flags; on a question Y/B/X/A lock answers by position, LT unlocks, RT submits, LB/RB into the tray, A arms, A again plays, B disarms; try every joker and a wrong answer; check the glyphs match the pad and A sits only on the ringed button; touch a key or the mouse and the prompts go back to keys. With a PlayStation pad: glyphs switch to ✕○□△ and L1/R1/L2/R2. Audio: a pad-only start stays silent until a key or click (expected in the browser).', 'Part of plan 45, task 4. Runs after tasks 1–3 of this plan (226, 227 and the glyph task). Replaces task 229.
