- Input gap from MD-10: the overlay''s flat item list has no `root` / `focus.ts`; the difficulty and bundle editors need either rows fitting that list (←/→ values) or a nested modal scope with `root`, `data-focus-default`, `pad`, like `FlagList.svelte`.
