- `layout.py`: paths for `questions.<locale>.json`, `pool.<locale>.json`, names files.
- `load_names(locale)` in `app/server/categories.py` (or the module that loads categories for authoring): merges `app/data/names.<locale>.json` and every `app/data/bundles/<id>/names.<locale>.json`.
- `qgen export`: `pool.json` unchanged; per locale with a translation file, `app/data/pool.<locale>.json` (same version/shape; source play fields + translated text and `difficulty`, `status: approved`; only source approved + translatable, translation approved, not stale). Prints count, stale and left-out counts per locale. No `pool.es.json`.
- `qgen validate`: per-locale checks of plan 63 (header, ids, status, difficulty, required text fields via the shared per-question text check, not a copy); error on non-rejected translation of a `translatable: false`/rejected source; warnings for stale and for approved translations of non-approved sources; names checks (error for a name missing for something `pool.<locale>.json` uses, error for unknown name keys, warning count for other missing names); staleness of `pool.<locale>.json` and orphan `pool.<locale>.json` without translation file. Accept `translatable` on source questions of any status.

Verify (throw-away, no committed test): on the real repo with no translation files, `qgen validate` and `qgen export` pass and `app/data/` is unchanged; in a temp copy, a locale file with 3 entries (fresh, stale, non-translatable source) gives the expected export and errors/warnings.', '2026-10-12T18:14:16Z', '2026-10-12T18:17:46Z', 413, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (416, 63, 'Draft names.en/de for base and colombia', 'work', 'done', 880, '2026-10-12, app/data/names.{en,de}.json, app/data/bundles/colombia/names.{en,de}.json; qgen validate clean (no name warnings/errors)', 'Plan 63 task 3 (section "Translated names"). Hand-maintained files, not questions (D-36 doesn''t apply).

