INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (439, 66, 'Review, fix, record, audit per locale', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, authoring/tools/qgen.py (locale_questions, update_translations, tmp_ids, batch_questions/cmd_review/cmd_fix/cmd_record (record_translations)/audit_ids/audit_section per run locale; not-travelling review → translatable: false); verified on a worktree: tr-en-1 (6 ids) through review 1, fix (injected fix), review 2, record, audit; tr-en-2 not-travelling path; questions.json changed only in translatable; worktree discarded', 'Plan 66, step 3 (QT-3). Needs the prompt decision and the previous task.

- `cmd_review` with locale: payload = Spanish source + translation + rater notes + fact check + related translated questions + the source''s picked media (no search, no new pick); `review.md` + `translate-review.md`; `can_search_again: false`. Not-travelling ids get a one-line review (confirm → `translatable: false`, else translated next run).
