- With throw-away `pool.en.json` + `names.en.json` + a stub `en` catalog (or plan 24''s): switch both, names and questions in English; `Continuar` of a Spanish game stays Spanish. Keyboard only, pad. Delete the throw-away files.', '2026-10-12T19:36:55Z', '2026-10-12T19:58:01Z', 448, 0, NULL, NULL);
