Checks: `npm run check`, `npm run build`, `check:literals`; in the browser (or desktop shell) with a temp `TRIVIA_STATE` holding a crafted save: plenty left shows nothing, a level with ≤ 1 unseen shows the warning with the right range, none left the repeat line, an exhausted subcategory once and not on the next start. Never write `state/`.', '2026-10-13T00:44:11Z', '2026-10-13T05:07:59Z', 429, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (624, 46, 'Player: focus the name field on mount when there are no players', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, app/client/src/game/Player.svelte. Cause was not only the missing tick: go() keeps busy true through the fade-in, so the input was disabled when focus() ran. Fix: an $effect focuses the field once when loaded && !busy and there are no players (replaces the onMount focus). Checked in headless Chrome on a fresh TRIVIA_STATE: keyboard → field focused after Start, typing and Enter as before, no picker/Escribir; stubbed pad → A on Start lands on the field, next A opens the letter picker. npm run check/test/build, qgen validate pass.', 'Found by task 230. `app/client/src/game/Player.svelte` `onMount`: `loaded = true; if (players.length === 0) input?.focus();` runs before the `{#if loaded}` form renders, so `input` is still undefined and nothing gets focus (checked in Chromium: `document.activeElement` stays `body` on a fresh save). Plan 04 "Player" and plan 46 assume the field is focused on mount; with a pad the family must now press ↓ before A opens the letter picker.
- Fix: `await tick()` (svelte) between `loaded = true` and the focus.
- Check: `npm run check`; fresh save (`TRIVIA_STATE` temp dir), Start → Player: the field has focus; a pad A opens the letter picker directly; typing with the keyboard works as before.', '2026-10-13T01:07:39Z', '2026-10-13T01:12:37Z', 230, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (625, 59, 'Merge «Reportar pregunta» into the flag: dialog with optional note', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-13, app/client/src/game/FlagDialog.svelte (new), FlagList.svelte (was Reports.svelte), Game.svelte, Overlay.svelte, LetterPicker.svelte, letters.ts, engine/save.ts (v4 upgrade, setFlag with note), state.ts, game.ts/api.ts (report action gone), lib/api.ts, lib/types.ts, locales es/es-ES/en/de/xx (flag.*, picker.letters/marks; report.* and note_invalid dropped), app/server/save.py, authoring/tools/save_file.py, authoring/server/main.py, README, directory.md, plans 04/05/12/13. Headless Chrome walk: keyboard + mouse flag/edit/unflag, v2 report migrated, list with notes; real pad not walked (letter picker in note mode untested on a pad).', 'Gamemaster decision after the D25 play-test (see `pm decision list --answered --grep flag`): keep only the flag, give it the report''s dialog.

- Flag icon click and `flag.key` (M in es) open a dialog like the report confirm: title, optional free-text note, Enter flags, Esc/⌫ cancels; flagging an already flagged question: offer unflag or edit the note
