- Drop the overlay item «Reportar pregunta»; keep the list (rename to «Preguntas marcadas» or similar) with «Copiar» for players without authoring tools; the note shows in the list and in the copied text
- Save: one structure for flags and reports (migrate `reports` rows and `flags` into it, bump the save version); old saves keep their entries
