- Catalog: es/en/de/xx leaves for the dialog; drop unused `report.*` leaves; `check:literals` passes
- Docs: README line on `M` (also says it marks «needs work» on the next `trivia-authoring` start), plans 04 and 13 (MD-6, GM-5)', '2026-10-13T02:50:43Z', '2026-10-13T03:45:14Z', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (626, 82, 'Vite native config loader warning: import extensions in config files', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-13, app/client/credits.ts: .ts extension on the types import; vite.config.ts of app/client and authoring/ui have no other extensionless relative imports; npm run build prints no configLoader warning', 'Gamemaster saw on `npm run build -w app/client` (2026-10-13):

