INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (655, 86, 'Achievements engine and page wiring', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-13, app/client/src/engine/achievements.ts (+ .test.ts), app/client/src/lib/achievements.ts, lib/engine.ts (load + checkpoint wiring), engine/game.ts (export gameMode), app/desktop/main.mjs (stderr on refused unlock), directory.md; decision 139: Achievement triggers derived without a save change (SW-11). Checked: Steam client + app 480 + real user → FIRST_WIN/FIRST_SOPLO/SOPLO_SAVE calls go out, refused (expected); TRIVIA_DEV_STEAM_USER=1 with Steam init failing → no calls, page loads clean.', 'Plan 86 task 2. Needs the answered list decision 73 (task 654; `pm decision list --answered --grep chievement`) and task 776: Valid Steam user check and dev switch (TRIVIA_DEV_STEAM_USER) (`validUser` in `lib/desktop.ts`); if either is missing: `pm task-pending-decision` on 73 / stop and say so. The `admin_replace` outcome comes from task 813: Dev mode «Ir a pregunta…» (open a question by id); if it isn''t in yet, check the outcome string anyway (no row has it, so nothing changes).

- `app/client/src/engine/achievements.ts`: `ACHIEVEMENTS` (API name, mode or none), `qualifies(row)` (plan 86 "Rules": `gameMode() !== "gamemaster"` per decision 74: Gamemaster mode earns no achievements, `!settings.customized`, no `settings.difficulty`, `levels` missing or 12, `cards` missing or 4, no `history[].outcome === "admin_replace"` (dev «Ir a pregunta…», any mode)), pure `earned(save, data) → AchievementId[]` over all players'' game rows; `ALL_CATEGORIES` per the plan (base bundle categories with questions in the loaded pool''s locale; questions not in the pool ignored). Only ids in Steamworks now get unlocked (mode wins for modes not in `BUILT_MODES` stay in the list, filtered out). Derived from the save only: no save field.
- Page: unlock `earned()` minus ids sent this session via `steam.unlock` (`lib/desktop.ts`), only when `validUser && steam?.available` (the dev switch without a Steam client makes no calls): at game end (won/lost/abandoned) and once after the save loads (retroactive: `--import-save` saves, games before publishing, failed calls). Pattern: rich presence in `Game.svelte`. No UI of our own, no stats, no progress pop-ups.
- `app/desktop/main.mjs`: stderr log when `unlockAchievement` returns false.
- Optional: one `node:test` over a fixture save (qualifying/customized/gamemaster/`admin_replace`/categories) only if it stays useful.

Done when: under Steam (480 or real App ID) with a logged-in user the unlock calls go out (stderr shows false on 480: expected); `TRIVIA_DEV_STEAM_USER=1 trivia-desktop` without Steam makes no calls and plays normally; `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-13T05:48:40Z', '2026-10-13T20:25:51Z', 653, 0, NULL, NULL);
