  - Step list for every screen and dialog: language, start, player, choice/configure, customize, level, select, question incl. each joker, correct, wrong, victory, Esc menu general + gamemaster cheats, confirm dialogs, flag dialog, flag list, credits, supply notice/report, letter picker, game settings. Also the telemetry consent screen (`screens/Consent.svelte`, task 890: shows when the stub''s `telemetry.state()` → `{available: true, consent: null}`) and the Esc menu with the «Datos anónimos» row + info line (stub `telemetry` with `available: true`). Desktop bridge stubbed via `addInitScript` (valid Steam user) so desktop-only rows (quit, Steam notice) show; the dev server''s page shim (`app/client/devshell.js`) sets `window.triviaShell` after init scripts and marks `devServer: true` (hides quit), so the stub must win over it (e.g. a non-writable property, or wrap the shim''s save methods). 1920 × 1080. Options `--locale`, `--only <shot>`. Missing media fine.
