- Part 1 first (App ID, names, terms) → part 2 → parts 3, 4, 7.
- Part 3 → part 4 (user gate, Cloud) and part 5 (unlocks).
- Part 6 → part 7 → first `beta` upload → part 10 and part 11.
- Part 1 (PUB-7, PUB-10) → part 8 → part 9.
- Part 11 last.

## Out of scope (from the milestone)
- Public release: coming-soon page, wishlists, release checklist, patches (S6, milestone 11). Remote Play Together (SW-13), macOS (SW-14), online co-op (decision 111): later. Steam Workshop bundles (decision 66): own milestone. Marketing.', '2026-10-13T16:56:05Z', '2026-10-13T16:57:37Z', 832, 0, NULL, NULL);
