  - `plans/project.md` in sync; `directory.md` only if a file is added.
- Delete the throw-away script.

Done when: at 1280×800 every image question''s picture can be seen whole via the peek (milestone 8); the owning plan files carry the notes. Check: `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate`.', '2026-10-13T17:58:50Z', '2026-10-14T06:57:28Z', 920, 0, NULL, NULL);
