- Public release: coming-soon page, wishlists, release checklist, patches (S6, milestone 11). Remote Play Together (SW-13), macOS (SW-14), online co-op (decision 111): later. Steam Workshop bundles (decision 66): own milestone. Marketing.', '2026-10-13T17:59:23Z', '2026-10-13T18:00:58Z', 913, 0, NULL, NULL);
