- `rollupOptions.output`: `preserveModules: true`, `preserveModulesRoot: "src"`; `entryFileNames`/`chunkFileNames`/`assetFileNames` as functions (`[name]` drops `.svelte` and collides `App.svelte` with `app.css` → `App2.js`):
