INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (945, 111, 'Override by path: throw-away proof (component JS, component CSS, theme.css)', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-13, nothing committed (throw-away). Used plan 112''s real overlay instead of a roots() edit: temp mod (mod.json + game/Hud.svelte.js, game/Hud.svelte.css, game/theme.css edited from a fresh build) via TRIVIA_MODS_DIR, dev shell under Xvfb (TRIVIA_DEV_STEAM_USER=1, TRIVIA_DEVTOOLS=1, own --user-data-dir, temp TRIVIA_SAVE_DIR), CDP script: new player → solo → level 1 question screen. Without mod: HUD ''Nivel 1'', .level rgb(255,184,28), --night-900 #0b1120. With mod: ''MODDED Nivel 1'', rgb(255,0,255), #00ff00 (stage background green); question, media, jokers fine, no errors. Source maps: game/Hud.svelte.js.map and game/Game.svelte.js.map sources resolve to /src/game/Hud.svelte, /src/game/Game.svelte. Note: an overridden JS keeps our .map unless the mod ships its own (stale lines in devtools only). Temp dir deleted, state/desktop/mods.json restored.', 'Plan 111 task 2. Prove a mod can replace single files of the readable build (task 1) by path. Throw-away: nothing committed.

