- Plan 99 (`Retire the browser game and the Python game server`) isn''t done: add a line to its open `task 762: Node dev server for browser checks` (`pm task set 762 --body …`, keep its text) that its built-client command (`vite preview`) must serve the readable tree; `vite` dev is unaffected. If 762 is done by then, check `vite preview` directly.

Done when: those commands pass; build size per depot noted in the done note (expected + ~2 MB).', '2026-10-13T18:28:37Z', '2026-10-13T21:49:07Z', 911, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (948, 111, 'Start time on the Steam Deck: gamemaster check (decision once)', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-14, no files: decision 149 answered (bundle the Svelte runtime), follow-up task 1025 in plan 111', 'Plan 111 task 5. ~200 module requests over `app://` instead of 3 may slow the start. Runs after task 944 (readable build config); doesn''t block the other tasks.

