INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (958, 114, 'Workshop check under Steam (gamemaster checklist)', 'work', 'open', NULL, NULL, 'Plan 114 task 4. Waits for the Steamworks Workshop setup decision; run after the bridge task (`mods:list`/`mods:set`) and, if it exists by then, plan 119''s publish command (`trivia-desktop --publish-mod`; packaged: the game executable).

Workers never log in to Steam: this task only writes the checklist and handles the answer.
- `pm decision add --once "Workshop check under Steam passed?"`, options "passed" (recommended) / "issues (name the failing rows)", body a short checklist:
