- If `task 977: publish.mjs: validate, stage, upload; workshopId in mods.mjs` is done: `preparePublish` calls `checkMod` (its errors/warnings shown as warnings only). If not done yet: add a follow-up task in plan 119 for it.

## Done when
- `trivia-desktop-build --dir` has `modding/` in `linux-unpacked/` and `win-unpacked/`.
- `trivia-release-check --skip tag` passes its `modkit` and `credits` steps.
- Per-commit checks pass.', '2026-10-13T18:36:03Z', '2026-10-14T17:49:24Z', 940, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (986, 120, 'Docs: player bundle kit, --check-mod; decision 133 consequences', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-14, directory.md (modding/ row, check-mod.mjs), AGENTS.md (trivia-desktop --check-mod), plans/18-steam-integration.md ''Modding'' (--check-mod, kit shipped), plans/22-bundles.md ''Player bundles (mods)'' (links modding/bundles.md, bundle-prompt.md, template), decision 133 consequences; README.md how-to skipped per decision 144 (README.md is customer-facing: modding docs live in modding/README.md), the guide (task 988) carries it', 'Part 6 of plan 120, last. After tasks 1–5 of this plan.

