- UI is the next tasks; until then the client may not render `completed`: fine.', '2026-10-15T13:18:53Z', '2026-10-15T13:24:22Z', 1121, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1124, 137, 'UI: answers switch on the configure screen and in the game settings dialog', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-15, game/screens/Choice.svelte (answers row, lock icon, opens on playerChoice, sent with new), game/GameSettings.svelte (answers switch: ←/→, Enter/A, click; sent with settings; pressable like Choice so Enter on the switch toggles), locales/{es,en,de}.ts configure.answers «Responder para avanzar» / «Answer to advance» / «Antworten zum Aufsteigen» (es-ES inherits, impersonal; xx generated). Checked: npm run check (check:literals), npm test, npm run build, qgen validate; gallery choice-gamemaster + game-settings es/de; throw-away Playwright walk: configure ←/→/Enter/click toggle, new game saves answers:false, dialog ←/→/Enter/click, apply saves answers:false/removes it, next configure screen opens on false. Follow-up: menu row/dialog title rename task.', 'Part of `plan 137: Gamemaster mode: «select answer to advance to next level»`; needs the engine task (`settings.answers`, `changeSettings`). Spec: plan 13 "Gamemaster mode" (MD-13).

