- Check: `media.fetch_for` on q-1425 slot `media` succeeds; no test
- Then the resume task "Finish batch-8 after task 1128" runs (priority -99)', '2026-10-15T13:48:08Z', '2026-10-15T13:50:42Z', 51, 0, NULL, NULL);
