Done when: `app/data/bundles/colombia/categories.json` and its names files match the answer.', '2026-10-15T19:02:56Z', '2026-10-16T03:32:08Z', 1136, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1140, 138, 'Remap colombia''s existing questions onto its new taxonomy', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-16: qgen remap --bundle colombia (authoring/tools/qgen.py, prompts/remap.md; 1 opus call $0.43): 109 colombia questions on decision 249''s list, 91 moved, no additions; concepts 17 kept, 41 cleared; 3 concept lists renamed, 7 deleted; validate requires own-bundle subcategory (D-100 grace gone); qgen export; D-109, plans/22-bundles.md, 15c RG-6, README.md. Checks: npm run check, npm test, npm run build, qgen validate pass.', 'Part 4 of `plan 138: Regional taxonomy: a general list, colombia reworked`, only for `colombia` (`decision 166: colombia subcategories (OQ-46): where the 19 go, and the list for 2000`). Runs after `task 1139: colombia taxonomy: proposal, the developer''s answer, apply`; still open → stop and say so.

## State from task 1139
- Done: `app/data/bundles/colombia/categories.json` is decision 249''s list (14 categories, 53 subcategories), committed.
- `qgen validate` fails on 67 `colombia` questions on removed subcategories; `app/data/pool.json` not re-exported since: this task fixes both.

## Migration step in `qgen`
- Like `cmd_bundles` (`authoring/tools/qgen.py`, prompt `prompts/bundles.md`): an LLM proposes, the proposal is kept in `work/`, then applied through `qgen`; no hand edits of `authoring/data/questions.json`. Reports its claude calls (`decision 208: What must a script that calls claude report to its caller?`).
- Every `colombia` question (all 109, any status, also the 19 on `base` subcategories) gets the fitting subcategory of the new list.
- None fits → a new subcategory (or category) is added to `colombia`''s `categories.json` with en/de names (through `qgen taxonomy --apply` or the migration step itself, not by hand); list every addition in the task note.
- Concepts as BN-13 (D-49): kept and added to the target subcategory''s concept list if it has one, else cleared. Old lists in `authoring/data/bundles/colombia/concepts/` whose subcategory is gone: renamed to the new subcategory when it is the same topic, else deleted.
- Translations, media, reviews keyed by question id stay as they are.

## Validate rule
- `qgen validate`: a question''s subcategory is in its own bundle''s list (fails on a `colombia` question on a `base` subcategory, and on any removed subcategory); the D-100 grace for the 19 goes.
- `qgen export`; per-commit checks (`npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate`).

## Docs
- D-entry in `plans/decisions.md` (amends D-43/D-99 for colombia''s list; points at `authoring/data/regional-categories.json` and `qgen taxonomy`).
- `plans/22-bundles.md` (colombia''s list), `plans/15c-regional-questions.md`.
- `pm decision consequences 166 "…"`.

Out of scope: other regional bundles (`plan 98: Regional packs (RG-3..RG-5)`, tasks 1275–1280); they have no questions to move.

Done when: every `colombia` question is on a `colombia` subcategory, `validate` enforces it, checks pass.', '2026-10-15T19:02:56Z', '2026-10-16T03:48:48Z', 1136, 0, NULL, NULL);
