- Generic parts, read only: `run_locale` tags `tr-<locale>-<n>`, `reviews.HEADER` `[\w-]+`, `authoring/steam/release_check.py` `pools()`, telemetry `locale`, `report-server/src/validate.ts` `LANG`.

## Docs
