INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1275, 98, 'Regional drafting in any launch language (en US/UK, de, es-ES, es)', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-16, authoring/tools/prompts/locale-{en,es,es-ES,de}.md, translate-region.md (decision 266 applied; code and docs from d4d323e)', 'Plan 98 part 10. Makes `qgen` draft a regional bundle in its region''s own language and variety, and translate it to en from `de` and `es-ES`, so the bundles `usa` (en, US English), `germany` (de), `uk` (en, British English), `spain` (es-ES), `mexico` (es, Mexican Spanish) can be set up (plan 98 tasks 11–15: tasks 1276–1280) and run (`plan 84: Release content runs` chain 5, tasks 1268–1272). Today the regional chain assumes Spanish (`colombia`).

Binding: `decision 110: Regional packs at launch (RG-5, OQ-46)` as amended by milestone 9 (developer, 2026-10-15); milestone 9''s slug keys (developer, 2026-10-16; masterplan part 16, plan from `task 1305: write plan: Slug keys for categories`); `decision 235: Source locale per question and translations from either source (English-first base)` (`translations.draft_locale(bundle)` = a regional bundle''s first `languages` entry; `--translate <L> [--bundle]` from any source locale ≠ L); `decision 213: General category list for regional bundles`; `decision 167: Translation prompt for a regional bundle (en for colombia)`; `decision 239: English-first drafting prompts: apply?`; `decision 250: Regional drafting in en, de, es-ES: prompts apply?` (answer 3: don''t apply; redraft after slug keys; its "names stay Spanish keys in every bundle" is void); prompts are the developer''s (decision 35, RUNBOOK). Read plan 98''s "Gaps today" and `plan 148: English-first drafting for base` (its task 4 checked Spanish-only helpers for `en`).

## Before starting
- Needs part 16''s slug keys applied: categories and subcategories keyed by English slugs, names only from `names.<locale>.json`, `qgen taxonomy` proposing slugs + en names and its taxonomy prompt changes applied (the slug plan''s tasks, `pm plans list`). Not there yet → `pm task-pending-decision 1275 <its open slug decision>` if one exists, or stop and say so.

## Already done (run 1256, commit d4d323e; keep, rebase on the slugs)
- `qgen bundle new --kind region --language <L> --voice "…"`: `languages: [L]`; help texts, `bundles.json` `about`.
- `bundle_text()` passes a bundle''s voice to drafts in its own locale whatever the language; `{voices}` per prompt locale.
- `qgen taxonomy --apply`: the bundle''s voice reaches the names call for its own language.
