      - each its DLC entry like `colombia`: `steam.json` `dlc`, DLC app and depot (`plan 130: Steamworks app configuration (SW-7)`, `plan 89: Builds, depots and upload (SW-10, SW-6)`), store texts and capsules (`plan 88: Store page and AI disclosure (PUB-8, LUI-6)`); part 10''s plan adds a follow-up task to each of them per bundle
