## Guard
- `pm plans list`, `pm show` of plans 57, 62–64, 66–70, 98, 100, 126, 136, 138, 147, 148 and `plan 149: Slug keys for categories` (all tasks done or dropped) and plan 84''s chains 1–3 (neutral Spanish, translation pilot (no go/no-go), full translation per locale `en`, `de`, `es-ES`, `es`) at their end. Not plan 84''s chains 4–5 (regional) nor the pilot-effort task (task 4''s). `plan 17: Batch runs` isn''t waited for.
- One has open tasks: if one is pending on a decision, `pm task-pending-decision <this task> <that decision>`; otherwise stop without changes. Never drop or edit other plans'' tasks.

## Steps
- `qgen validate`; `trivia-media sync --status approved`; `qgen export`.
- `qgen report --simulate` (default matrix: every question locale `es`, `es-ES`, `en`, `de`, default bundles, all age groups, all modes); `qgen report --locale <L>` for `es`, `es-ES`, `en`, `de`; `qgen report --qc` (release-ready column; drafted batches and back-audit slices only); `qgen report --cost` (information: spent, $ per approved).
- Record in `plans/16-content-target.md` ("Where we stand" → dated close-out result): per locale approved vs. 5000 and per level, ✓/✗, games per new player (median, p10, strong bound) for adults solo, bottlenecks, release-ready state, total spent per language (en drafting + translations, plan 70), file sizes of `app/data/pool*.json` and pack pools (task 3 uses them for the install size).

