- `pool.es-ES.json` exported (decision 156: an `es-ES` save plays it once its default bundles'' supply passes, else `es`; the browser row is task 2''s).

## Shortfall
- A ✗ or a drafted batch/slice not release-ready: no fix. If plan 84 has no open pair for that locale: `pm decision add "S4 target not met for <locale>: more runs or lower the target?"` (body: the numbers; options "more runs: plan 84 adds pairs" (recommended), "lower the target (D-75 amended)", "ship as is"), `pm task-pending-decision` for this task and tasks 2–3 of plan 128 (`task 1033: Language picker, UI wording, joker and slug-key check`, `task 1034: Docs close-out of S4`), stop. On the answer "more runs": `pm task add 84` the next run/QC pair (a drafted batch) or `--translate` run (no QC task), stop (this task waits for it).

Done when: `qgen report --simulate` exits 0 for all four question locales (or an answered decision accepts the shortfall), the result is in `plans/16-content-target.md`.', '2026-10-16T03:54:03Z', '2026-10-23T01:28:50Z', 1293, 0, NULL, 'questions');
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1295, 84, 'run colombia batch (batch-<n>)', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-22, Done: batch-12: 253 merged, 239 approved, 14 needs work (took 26m51s); claude: 172 calls, opus 165 / sonnet 7, 4.6M tokens, $12.41 (plus earlier 9 factcheck calls $0.63); report authoring/reports/batch-12.md', 'Plan 84 chain 4, first es pair of the regional pilot `colombia` (`decision 110: Regional packs at launch (RG-5, OQ-46)`), added by `task 643: Regional pilot colombia: start`. Prerequisites done: `plan 138: Regional taxonomy: a general list, colombia reworked` (colombia''s taxonomy applied, questions remapped), colombia target 2000 in `authoring/data/targets.json`.

