## Order
- Decisions first: plans 35, 37, 38, 41 (milestone 7) → parts 1, 3, 8, 10 can be written.
- Part 10: `plan 138` (colombia''s taxonomy) → colombia''s first batch (part 11) → part 16 (slug keys) → the other bundles'' taxonomies and runs, by audience.
- Engine (M2) + plan 27 → part 1 → part 9.
- Part 3 → part 4 → part 5 → part 11''s pilot → full runs (no budget step).
