    - `qgen taxonomy` proposes slugs with en names and drafts `es`/`de` names on `--apply`; `regional-categories.json` follows. The prompt changes are the developer''s (pm decision, like decision 250), and `task 1275: Regional drafting in any launch language (en US/UK, de, es-ES, es)`''s redraft builds on them.
    - Replaces the name-as-key part of decision 165: Subcategory keys in code: bundle + name; base keeps bare names, D-99, D-100: recorded with `pm decision record … --supersedes`, `plans/decisions.md` amended.
    - Before the new regional taxonomies (`task 1276: Set up regional bundle usa` … `task 1280: Set up regional bundle mexico`) and `task 1275`; the plan makes them wait (pending on its slug decision).
    - Suggested priority: 880 (schema; keys everywhere).

## Order
- Decisions first: plans 35, 37, 38, 41 (milestone 7) → parts 1, 3, 8, 10 can be written.
- Part 10: `plan 138` (colombia''s taxonomy) → colombia''s first batch (part 11) → part 16 (slug keys) → the other bundles'' taxonomies and runs, by audience.
