## Out of scope (from the milestone)
- Store page translations (LUI-6, S5); Steamworks language detection (S5, milestone 10; part 6 switches its guess to it); competitive mode and couch co-op (Later).', '2026-10-16T12:30:33Z', '2026-10-16T12:39:07Z', 1297, 0, NULL, NULL);
