- Flag 18 (`screen.question.final`, shot `question-locked`, «Final answer»): "needs a nice icon". Flag 21 (`overlay.quit`, shot `menu-start`, «Quit game»): "needs icon". Draw in `app/client/src/game/Icon.svelte` (VD-8 style: 24×24, `currentColor`, stroke 2.4, rounded, body fill-opacity 0.25, playful, like the existing icons; reuse one if it fits, e.g. a lock for the locked final answer, a door/exit for quit).
- Mark flags 15, 18, 21 fixed: `"fixed_on": "<date>"` in `ui-flags.json`.
- Docs: `plans/15a-ui-translation.md` "Joker names" (purge leaves for es/de listed there), `plans/09-jokers.md` if it quotes the purge text; `rg` the old purge strings over `.md` files.
- Check: `npm run check` (incl. `check:literals`), `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate`; `trivia-gallery --only joker-skip,question-locked,menu-start` for all four locales.', '2026-10-16T14:54:55Z', '2026-10-16T15:01:21Z', 1101, 0, NULL, NULL);
