Check: `qgen batch` resumes past `rate` for batch-9 (`work/batch-9/ratings/revised-01-19.json` exists). Partial batch-9 data is staged (`authoring/data` passes `qgen validate`).', '2026-10-16T19:19:07Z', '2026-10-16T21:36:38Z', 1185, 0, NULL, 'questions');
