- Correct: seat level +1, new table; wrong: seat `phase = "lost"`, `out: true`, `result: "lost"`; turn passes to the next seat that isn''t `out`, wrapping
- Ends: correct at the last level → that seat `won`, every other seat still in `lost`, `row.result = "won"`; one seat left in → it wins at once, whatever its level (decision 278); `row.state.phase` mirrors the end; `finished_on` as solo
- `view()`: top-level fields from `seats[turn].state`; a finished session: the winner''s, else the last answerer''s; `session.seats[]` per seat (status, level, age group, jokers left)
