INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1412, 159, 'Timed core in the engine: clock, claims, rounds, lives, ends', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-16, app/client/src/engine/game.ts (timed: newSession, settle, claim, expire, timedAnswer, rounds, ends), state.ts (TimedState, Io.ms, history fields, error codes), choice.ts (QUESTION_MS, HINT_MS, CLAIM_MS, LIVES), api.ts (claim, expire), lib/engine.ts (io ms), session.test.ts', 'Implement the core of `plan 159: Competitive (timed) in the engine` ("Clock", "State", "Starting", "Actions" without pause/resume, "A question ends", "Round end"), on top of `plan 158: Round-robin modes in the engine` (`task 1407: rr-coop in the engine: session start, turns, team game`, `task 1408: rr-competitive in the engine: per-seat games, session supply, ends`: session start, `actor(row, seat)`, `HistoryEntry.seat`, `view().session`, `session.test.ts`). Binding: `decision 276: Timed mode: after a drop-out, how many questions does a round have?`, `decision 277: Multiplayer sessions in the save: one games[] row per session, with seats`, `decision 280: Timed mode: everyone out at one round end means nobody wins`, `decision 281: Timed mode: round 12 without a correct answer repeats as another sudden-death round`.

## Do
- `Io.ms?: number` (epoch ms); `lib/engine.ts` `io()` sets `Date.now()`; missing = `Date.parse(io.now)`
- Constants next to `STANDARD_JOKERS` (`engine/state.ts`): `QUESTION_MS = 30000`, `HINT_MS = 8000`, `CLAIM_MS = 6000`, `LIVES = 3`; deadlines inclusive, no grace
- `row.state.timed` (additive, no `SAVE_VERSION` bump): `round_size`, `round_done`, `round_correct`, `shown_at`, `claim: {seat, at} | null`, `paused_at: null` (field only; pause is the next task), `repeat`; `Seat.lives`
- `new` with `mode: "timed"`: plan 158''s session start; one `age_group`; `jokers` refused (`timed_no_jokers`), budget all 0, `customized` false; `cards: 0`, question opened at once (solo''s `openIfNoCards`); `shown_at` = start; supply check N per level (N = players) via plan 158''s seat × level matching, `supply_short` as today
- Draw per question: `selection.draw` n = 1 at `level`, `perLevel` = `round_size`; never a question in `offered`; categories avoided over the session''s history; extra round-12 rounds: same draw, empty → the age group''s whole range, still empty → session ends, no winner; never `level_empty` mid-session
- `settle(row, ms)` first in every timed action: claim past `at + CLAIM_MS` → wrong (timeout); unclaimed past `shown_at + QUESTION_MS` → expired
- `claim {seat}`: `claim_taken` if a claim is open; stores `{seat, at: ms}`; the question clock stops; too late → the settled state, no error
- `answer {seat, index}`: `claim_first`, `not_your_claim`; late → settled as timeout, not an error
- `expire` (no seat; plan 157''s `actor` skips it): `settle`; nothing passed → `not_expired` (409, `ms` left)
- `joker`, `pick`, `skip`, `reveal` refused (`timed_no_jokers`, `no_cards`, `gamemaster_only`); `abandon` = whole session
- Question end: correct → `round_correct`; round 12 → that seat `won`, others `lost`, `row.result = "won"`; wrong/timeout → seat `out`, `lost`; one seat left → it wins at once; unclaimed → nothing else; each: `see()` once, one `HistoryEntry` `{level, question_id, correct, seat?, chosen, hints}` + `timeout: true` / `unclaimed: true`, hints = `min(hints, floor((at − shown_at) / HINT_MS))`; `last` with `seat`; `round_done + 1`; round complete → round end, else next question (`shown_at` = ms)
- Round end: seats in without a correct answer lose a life, 0 → `out`, `lost`; nobody left → `row.result = "lost"`, phase `lost` (decision 280); one left → wins; round < 12 → `level + 1`, round 12 → another level-12 round, `repeat + 1` (decision 281); reset `round_size` (seats in), `round_done`, `round_correct`
- New `ERRORS` codes (D-57): `claim_taken`, `claim_first`, `not_your_claim`, `not_expired`, `timed_no_jokers` (`paused`, `already_paused`, `not_paused` with the next task)
- `session.test.ts`, timed half, seeded `Io` with `ms`: claim and answer, claim timeout, `not_expired`, round end life loss, decision 276''s round size after a drop-out, round 12 win, round 12 repeat, nobody wins, last one standing

## Done when
- `npm run check`, `npm test` (fixture replay unchanged), `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass
- `timed` played to each end in `session.test.ts`; `BUILT_MODES` unchanged', '2026-10-16T21:02:30Z', '2026-10-16T22:05:50Z', 1410, 0, 'opus', 'app');
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1413, 159, 'Timed pause and view in the engine', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-16, engine/game.ts, state.ts, api.ts, lib/types.ts, session.test.ts, plans/13-game-modes.md', 'Implement the rest of `plan 159: Competitive (timed) in the engine` ("Actions": `pause`/`resume`, "`view()`"), on top of the previous task of this plan (timed core: `Io.ms`, `row.state.timed`, `settle`, claim/answer/expire). Binding: `decision 282: Timed mode: the Esc menu and the Steam overlay pause the clock and hide the question`; D-92: nothing pauses outside `timed`.

## Do
- `pause` (no seat): `paused_at` = ms (`already_paused`); `settle` first, not while paused
- `resume` (no seat): shifts `shown_at` and `claim.at` by the paused span, clears `paused_at` (`not_paused`)
- While paused: `claim`, `answer`, `expire` refused (`paused`); `settle` does nothing
- `ERRORS` (D-57): `paused`, `already_paused`, `not_paused`
- `view()`: plan 158''s `session` block plus per seat `lives`, `correct_this_round`, `last_chance` (round''s last question, no correct answer yet this round)
