- Win-based (FIRST_WIN, WINS_10, WINS_50, WIN_ADULTS, WIN_ALL_AGES, WIN_NO_JOKERS, ALL_JOKERS_WIN, SOPLO_SAVE, NIGHT_OWL, POLYGLOT): tower wins only, one per session, age group and jokers of the winning game
