INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1432, 161, 'Seats and the per-player input filter', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-16, app/client/src/lib/{seats.ts,seats.svelte.ts,input.svelte.ts,gamepad.svelte.ts,gamepad.ts,api.ts}, game/question/keys.ts, game/{Game,Overlay,FlagDialog,CornerButtons}.svelte, game/screens/Question.svelte, plans/14-input.md', 'Part 2 of `plan 161: Per-player controls` (read its Model, Filter and Binding sections; `decision 288: Local multiplayer: who opens the Esc menu in a session, and who drives it`, `decision 273: Keyboard-only turn-based sessions: what does a player''s own key do?`, `decision 274: Pads plus keyboard: one keyboard player, or several key players?`, `decision 277: Multiplayer sessions in the save: one games[] row per session, with seats`). Needs `task 1406: Acting seat in the engine API` and `task 1380: Pad: any button or stick switches prompts to glyphs`, `task 1381: Mouse move switches prompts to keys` done; findings of `task 1431: Pad count, identity and per-pad style: measure in Electron and Steam` in `plans/14-input.md` section 3 if there (else bind by index, style from `Gamepad.id`).

Build (`app/client/src/lib/`):
- `Source` (`{ pad: index }` | `"keyboard"` | `"mouse"`) on every `Action` in `input.svelte.ts` (keys, pads in `gamepad.svelte.ts`, clicks); `device` stays
- `seats.ts` (pure): `Binding` (`{ pad }` | `"kbm"` | `{ key }` | `"shared"`), `seatOf(source, intent, view)`, `may(seat, view)` from `view().session` (round-robin: turn; timed: claim open → claimer, else any seat in; out seats never)
- `seats.svelte.ts` (state): session binding set/cleared by the join screen (part 6), kept in `sessionStorage` by game id; no session → no filter
- `dispatch` filter: `menu` always passes; scopes marked `shared` (Esc menu, flag dialog, results/victory, lost-pad dialog) take every device; else only if `may(seat)`; dropped actions do nothing (no sound, no focus move)
- Mouse: capture-phase `pointerdown`/`click` listener drops clicks when the top scope isn''t shared and keyboard-and-mouse may not act; `[data-shared]` controls always pass
- `acting.seat` set synchronously while an accepted action or click runs; `lib/engine.ts` game actions take `seat` from it; the engine''s `not_your_turn`/`not_your_claim` stay the backstop
- Prompts: in a session only accepted input (and `touched` of a device that may act) moves `lastDevice`/`padStyle`; `padStyleOf(index)`, `seatDevice(seat)` → kind + style for parts 7 and 8
- Join helpers for part 6: bind an unbound pad''s A, the `kbm` join, `claimKeyOk(key, taken)` (decision 290 rules; export the Question screen''s key list once and import it, decision 199)
- Throw-away check with fake pads and a stubbed session view (deleted after)
- Docs: `plans/14-input.md` section 3 and IN-6 rewritten to what''s built, no "Later"; decision 24 noted as superseded by milestone 16; `rg` old names per decision 200

