INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1458, 165, 'Catalog checks for the multiplayer screens: key scopes, claim keys, string audit', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-17, app/client/scripts/check-literals.mjs, locales/de.ts, locales/style/de.md', 'Part 1 of `plan 165: Multiplayer UI strings and gallery`. Runs after the screen tasks of plans 162–164: `task 1437: Mode row and per-mode Choice for the multiplayer modes`, `task 1438: Join screen: seats, names, keyboard rules, claim keys, seat colours`, `task 1439: Session start through Bundles: session supply, new with players, binding, greeting`, `task 1445: Session screens and rr-coop: routing, seat tag, turn line, team screens`, `task 1446: rr-competitive screens: tracks, per-seat jokers, knocked out, winner`, `task 1449: Timed screen and flow: round screen, question for all, clock, claims, one-press answer`, `task 1450: Timed pause: Esc menu, hidden window, Steam overlay, «Pausa» veil`, `task 1451: Timed drama and sound: heart pulses, heartbeat, last-3-s ticks, red frame, timed track`, `task 1452: Timed sudden death and ends: «Muerte súbita», winner, last standing, nobody wins, resume line`. If any is still open, stop and say so.

Read `app/client/src/locales/style/<locale>.md` for es, es-ES, en, de first (AGENTS.md).

## Key scopes (`decision 53: Joker and action keys per UI language (LUI-4)?`)
- `app/client/scripts/check-literals.mjs` `SCREENS`: `choice` gains the three mode keys (`mode.<id>Key`, whatever names task 1437 used); new `join` and `timed` scopes with every key those screens show; `timed` in `ANSWERS` (A–D shown)
- Fix collisions in the catalogs, not by widening the rule

## Claim keys (`decision 290: Timed mode: the claim input per kind of player`)
- Throw-away script per locale: no key of `SCREENS.question`, nor A–D, 1–9, passes `claimKeyOk` (plan 161); delete it afterwards
- `claimKeyOk` must read the Question screen''s key list from the catalog, not a copy (decision 199); if it doesn''t: follow-up task in `plan 161: Per-player controls`

## String audit
- Every leaf the multiplayer screens added: `git log` of plans 162–164''s tasks over `app/client/src/locales/`
- Per guide: `es` addresses the group with ustedes; `es-ES` overrides (vosotros, regionalisms) wherever the group is addressed
- Plural maps for player counts («Ana, Luis y 2 más») in every catalog
- German length: seat names, «Muerte súbita», turn line; flag likely overflow for the gallery run (task 5 of the plan checks at 1280×800)
- Player names are data, not catalog text
- Mode names: keep `plans/15a-ui-translation.md` "Mode names" proposals unless a guide rule breaks them; the developer reviews them in the plan''s review decision
- New bad patterns into the guides

Done when: `npm run check` passes with the new scopes; `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-16T21:17:13Z', '2026-10-17T01:01:40Z', 1457, 0, NULL, 'app');
