Binding: `decision 73: Achievement list (SW-11)?`, `decision 285: Achievements from multiplayer sessions: every seat earns for the save; tower achievements need a win at the top level`, `decision 168: Store texts name only the built game modes`, `decision 90: Store requirements, languages and controller flags?`, `decision 293: Unbuilt multiplayer modes: on the mode row in dev mode only`, `decision 200: AGENTS.md rule: after a move, rename or delete, fix every comment and doc naming the old? (code review part 11)`.

## Gate (check first)
- Done: `task 1445: Session screens and rr-coop: routing, seat tag, turn line, team screens`, `task 1432: Seats and the per-player input filter`, `task 1434: Lost pads and the Esc menu in a session`, `task 1458: Catalog checks for the multiplayer screens: key scopes, claim keys, string audit`
- One not done → change nothing in pm, stop without closing (priority keeps this task after them); one dropped → follow-up task naming what''s missing, stop

## First run (no answered decision in `pm show`)
- Readiness check (throw-away, Node dev server `npm run dev -w app/client`, `devMode`): `rr-coop` start to finish once with fake pads (2 seats), once keyboard only; a failure → follow-up task in the plan that owns it, stop without closing
- Store text draft in `plans/17a-store-page.md`, per language block (en, es, es-ES where it differs, de): the mode in the modes sentence and bullets; names per `plans/15a-ui-translation.md` "Mode names" and the catalogs; marked "draft, with rr-coop"; controller line unchanged unless the mode needs a keyboard with pads only (then say so in the decision body)
- `pm decision add --once` "Ship Round-robin co-op: WIN_RR_COOP in Steamworks and store texts" (intro per AGENTS.md), body = steps for the developer:
  - after `decision 140: Achievements entered and published in Steamworks?` (or together with it): Steamworks → Stats & Achievements → new achievement `WIN_RR_COOP`, Hidden no, Set by Client, no stat
  - English name and description from `plans/18-steam-integration.md` "Achievements in Steamworks" row; per-language names and descriptions (latam, spanish, english, german) typed in or via the localization upload
  - icons `app/desktop/achievements/png/WIN_RR_COOP_achieved.png` / `WIN_RR_COOP_unachieved.png` (`render.sh`); publish
  - read the 17a draft; wording changes go in the answer
  - answer with the token Steamworks gave it (`NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_1_<n>`, from its localization download)
- `pm task-pending-decision <this task> <decision>`; stage the 17a draft; stop without closing

## Second run (decision answered)
- `app/client/src/engine/game.ts` `BUILT_MODES` += `rr-coop`; the mode''s `PLACEHOLDER(<this task>)` off its Choice tile (`game/screens/Choice.svelte`); `engine/achievements.test.ts` assertion updated if it names `WIN_RR_COOP`
- Demo matrix: `smoke.mjs --demo --matrix` (`authoring/steam/smoke.mjs` `matrix()`) throws `no matrix games for multiplayer modes yet` once a multiplayer mode is in `BUILT_MODES`, so `trivia-release-check --demo` step `matrix` goes ✗; cover this mode there (from dropped `task 1611: Demo matrix: multiplayer modes once one is built`): per age group one game with fake pads as `--multiplayer` injects them (reuse `launchPads`, `setup`, `turn`, `forward`, `claims`, `ended`), `MIN_SEATS` seats (rr-competitive: mixed seat groups once); a start refused for supply under `decision 348: Demo: cover multiplayer sessions up to how many seats?` (demo list `seats` 1) is traced, not ✗, unless the developer raised the seats; docs: `smoke.mjs` header, `release_check.py` docstring, `plans/11-steam.md` "Demo `matrix` step"; check: `trivia-release-check --demo` step `matrix` ✓ (the first shipped mode builds the multiplayer part, later ones add their mode)
- `app/desktop/steam-achievements.vdf`: `WIN_RR_COOP`''s `_NAME`/`_DESC` in all four languages under the answered token
- `plans/18-steam-integration.md`: the `WIN_RR_COOP` row into the "Now" table (count in the heading), its MD-8 / milestone 16 cell and `decision 140`''s "Not now" mention dropped for it
- `plans/17a-store-page.md`: draft → approved with the answer''s wording; entry row in the store checklist (`task 672: Store page entry checklist and PUB-8 close-out` if open, else a line for the next store edit)
- `plans/13-game-modes.md`: the mode''s box ticked with a done note; `plans/11-steam.md` row 14 / "Later" row: the mode shipped
- `pm decision consequences <id> "…"`; per-commit checks (AGENTS.md)
- No upload: the mode reaches players with the next `trivia-steam upload` (`plan 89: Builds, depots and upload (SW-10, SW-6)`)

Done when: `rr-coop` in `BUILT_MODES`, shown without `devMode`, `WIN_RR_COOP` in the VDF with the Steamworks token, 17a approved; demo `matrix` step ✓ with the mode; `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-16T21:19:20Z', NULL, 1464, 0, NULL, 'app');
