INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1473, 167, 'Headless: every multiplayer mode start to finish, release-check step multiplayer', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-16, authoring/steam/smoke.mjs (--multiplayer), authoring/tools/fake_pads.js (stub moved out of gallery.py, decision 199), authoring/tools/gallery.py, authoring/tools/engine_data.mjs (loadData dir), authoring/steam/release_check.py (step multiplayer after smoke, MANUAL multiplayer-pads full), AGENTS.md, plans/11-steam.md. All 9 sessions green on a fresh trivia-desktop-build --dir (584 s). Started with tasks 1453, 1463 still open (review-driven polish waiting on decisions 297, 314; no functional gap). Differs from the decisions / plan: (1) a session''s middle is played by the engine on the save, start and end on screen (decision 320); (2) keyboard-only round-robin has no seat that may not act (decision 273: shared keyboard), so those two sessions have no refused press; keyboard-only timed seats'' answer keys act for the claimer (decision 290), only another seat''s claim key is refused; (3) the quit and restart runs in the timed pads session (rebinds seats 0 and 2, the out seat 1 never asks); (4) rr-competitive''s mode win is also earned by last standing (MODE_WIN on any win), only tower achievements need level 12 (decision 285). Found: plan 172 (Keyboard seats after a restart: a resumed session asks for a pad) — keyboard-only and kbm seats can''t be taken after a quit, the session is stuck: blocks milestone 16''s keyboard-only resume, not this step. Task 1519 (packs without a pool): plain smoke''s without-packs stage and trivia-steam stage fail since the germany/mexico/spain/uk/usa folders shipped; pre-existing, the plain smoke''s own game and resume pass.', 'Part 1 of `plan 167: Local multiplayer close-out and family playtest`: a headless run plays all three local-multiplayer modes start to finish on the packaged Linux build with fake pads, and stays in the release check (`decision 299: Local multiplayer stays in the release check: smoke step multiplayer and a real-pad row`).

## Wait first
