- `authoring/steam/release_check.py`: step `multiplayer` in `STEPS` right after `smoke` (always, full and content-only); `MANUAL` row `multiplayer-pads` (full only): "beta under Steam with real pads (Steam Input on): one session per mode with every pad present, through Join to the first turn change or claim; every pad joins (note how many), each acts only for its seat".
- Docs: header comments of `release_check.py` and `smoke.mjs`; AGENTS.md `trivia-release-check` line (step list); `plans/11-steam.md` "Release checklist (ST-4)".

## Failures
- A bug found by the run → follow-up task per plan 167''s routing (save shape, resume → plan 157; round-robin rules → 158; timed rules → 159; achievements, telemetry → 160; wrong seat, claim inputs, lost pad, Esc menu → 161; mode row, Join, setup → 162; round-robin screens → 163; timed screens → 164; strings → 165; `BUILT_MODES` → 166; a plan already done: `pm plan add 16 …` named after the failure).
