      - per bundle: `qgen bundle new --kind region`, taxonomy decision, target in `targets.json`; each starts once `colombia`''s taxonomy (decision 249: colombia taxonomy: categories and subcategories) and its first `qgen batch --bundle colombia` have proven the chain, not after colombia''s 2000
