INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1501, 9, 'write plan: Translations without human control', 'plan', 'done', 1000, '2026-10-16, plan 171: Translations without human control (priority 700, work tree questions); no files', 'Part 4 and part 5 of `plan 9: masterplan` changed (milestone 9, "Question translations without human control", developer 2026-10-16; the tr-en-1 and tr-de-1 spot checks found every translation good). `plan 66: Translation pipeline (QT-2, QT-3)` and `plan 67: Review tool for translations (QT-4)` are done, so no revision reaches them: this task writes the plan (`pm plan add 9 …`, priority 700, work tree `questions`) that brings the tooling and docs in line. `plan 84: Release content runs` drops the per-run QC tasks and the go/no-go itself (`task 1498: revise plan 84: Release content runs`); don''t duplicate that.

What the plan covers:
- The LLM translation review is a translation''s only review, in every question locale (milestone 12''s included): no native-speaker spot check per `tr-*` run, no QC decision per run, no pilot go/no-go, no `qgen health ack` after a pilot.
- `qgen health` (`authoring/tools/health.py`, `translation_health_section` and the stop logic): the pilot (`tr-<locale>-1`) no longer stops the next `qgen batch --translate`; decision 45''s thresholds stay and a ✗ still stops it until `qgen health ack`.
- `pm decision record … --supersedes 45` for the clause "the pilot tr-<locale>-1 always stops the next run" (`decision 45: Health thresholds and selection order for qgen batch --translate runs`).
- Review tool (`authoring/server/spot_checks.py`, `overview.py`, `authoring/ui/src/review/`): no translation spot-check sample or banner asking for one; the developer can still open and review any `tr-*` run (`/review?batch=…&locale=L`); `qgen flag` still sets `needs_work`. What happens to `spot-checks.json` entries and `qgen validate` rules for `tr-*` runs: the plan decides (keep existing records valid).
- Docs: `authoring/QC.md` "Translation runs" (no spot check), `authoring/RUNBOOK.md`, `plans/15b-question-translation.md` (QT-5 without go/no-go, QT-6 without native-speaker spot check), D-87/D-55 in `plans/decisions.md` where they say otherwise; `rg` for "spot check", "go/no-go", "pilot" over `.md` files and comments (decision 200).
- Before the full translation runs of part 11 (`task 639: run tr-en-2`, `task 641: run tr-de-2`, `task 1226: run tr-es-ES-2`); if those would otherwise wait on the pilot''s stop, the plan says how they proceed.', '2026-10-16T22:38:17Z', '2026-10-16T23:13:06Z', 1495, 0, NULL, 'questions');
