INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1521, 17, 'QC batch-10', 'work', 'done', -100, '2026-10-17, authoring/reports/batch-10.md, authoring/data/questions.json, app/data pools. Decision 332 done (spot check 29/30, 97 %, vs batch-9 28/30; false needs_work 1, q-3410; 0 false approves; release bar ✓). No QC proposals (no problem kind with ≥2 disagreements, 0 major audit findings on approved, 0 fact false approves), so no proposals decision and no change tasks; report: Changes none. Health batch-10 ✗ like batch-9: drop rate 20.1 % (batch-9 21.6 %, batch-8 12.7 %), overlap rate 14.9 % (15.4 %, 5.5 %), top clue 51.4 % (52.8 %, 45.7 %) — drift from the switch to English drafts, already covered by plan 180. Other health ✓: needs_work 7.9 % (8.1 %), media 4.3 %, fun 3.56, $0.24 per approved. Media: no pick in review 1: 114, recovered 84, none at record 32; share 25.0 % (29.2 % batch-9); no new media finding. Overlap vs es pool: dropped overlap 154 drafts; no cross-language overlaps found in the 30 spot check. Approved vs target (es-sourced count, qgen report): 2015/5000 per source locale; short at every difficulty, worst 1: 45/250, 15: 17/125. Exit check: 3836 approved base, health ✗, spot checks ✓. Rework-5 (qgen rework --batch batch-10): batch-10 needs_work 74 -> 40 approved, 33 still need work ($8.25). Added task 1579 run batch-11 and task 1580 QC batch-11. Missing tooling: none; per-difficulty target vs rated vs reviewed table not in the report (not compared).', 'QC of batch-10, the second English `base` batch, per `authoring/QC.md` (plan 16) and `plan 17: Batch runs` "Per-batch pattern" 2 and "English-first batches". Added by `task 1186: QC batch-9`; same phases as that task. Runs after task 1520; if `authoring/reports/batch-10.md` doesn''t exist, stop without changes.

1. `pm decision add "Spot check batch-10 done?"` (body: `/review?batch=batch-10&sample=1` link, size 30 per `decision 234: Spot-check size for batch-9 and batch-10 (first English batches)?`, how to start `trivia-authoring`; option "done"), wait on it, stop.
