- Check the packaged demo start: `isDemo()` from `package.json`, demo title

Done when: `trivia-desktop-build --demo --dir` gives `app/desktop/release/demo/` with the demo names and `"demo": true` in its packaged `package.json`; the plain build unchanged; `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-17T13:25:07Z', '2026-10-17T15:01:06Z', 1532, 0, NULL, 'app');
