- Reports on: `report-server` validates Steam tickets of both App IDs (`STEAM_APP_ID` in `report-server/wrangler.toml` → a list, the code checks membership); a `wrangler.toml` comment names `authoring/steam/steam.json`''s `demo.appid`; local `trivia-report-server dev` with fake `dev-*` tickets still works
