INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1549, 175, 'Deterministic demo selection in the engine', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-17, engine/rng.ts (demoRng: FNV-1a of salt+site+item keys → mulberry32 + Fisher–Yates; actionRng(data); randomSeed now module-private), lib/engine.ts io(data) in exec() and load()''s repair, game.ts countOf(save, data) 0 in the demo (draw, timedDraw, Bájale, Cambiazo, jokersView, replaceCurrent) and outlook.ts ×2, engine/demo.test.ts (solo + timed run twice identical; second game on the first''s save gets the first''s questions; full-game actionRng differs; fails with demo off or with counts on), plans/03-game-flow.md + 12-client-engine.md Demo bullets, decisions.md D-58 note. Sites: draw (selection.draw for draw and timedDraw), pick, replacement, swap_in: all through io.rng, no others in engine/. lib/api.ts seededRng(0) view trial kept (comment still true: demoRng is stateless anyway). Running-out notice: runningOutBundles needs qs.length > fresh, never with counts 0; no extra code. Seen scan over app/client/src: no seen-count display (stats, players, achievements read none); only the Gamemaster «Cambiar pregunta» seen toggle (Overlay.svelte), which still writes a seen row that the demo ignores: harmless, no follow-up. By hand: TRIVIA_DEMO=1 dev client in headless Chrome via its own lib/api.ts: two games with the same choice gave the same 4 cards, question and answer order. check, test, build pass; qgen validate fails only on demo.json''s 79 pending translations (known, decision 348 consequence), not this change.', 'Part "Rng sites", "Seen counts off" and "Test" of `plan 175: Deterministic selection in the demo`; needs `EngineData.demo` from `task 1534: Demo flag in the client, engine and dev server`. Rng per `decision 340: Demo selection: every shuffle seeded from its site and the items it shuffles`; engine reads only `data.demo` (`decision 338: Demo flag: TRIVIA_DEMO at build, dist-demo, package.json demo, EngineData.demo`).

- `engine/rng.ts`: `demoRng()`: each `shuffle(xs, site)` seeds mulberry32 from a hash (FNV-1a or the like) of a fixed salt, `site` and the items'' keys (`id` if the item has one, else `String(x)`), then Fisher–Yates as `seededRng`; no counter, time, game id or `randomSeed()`. `actionRng(data)` = `data.demo ? demoRng() : seededRng(randomSeed())`
- `lib/engine.ts` `io()` takes the action''s `EngineData`, uses `actionRng(data)` (`exec()` and `load()`''s `repair` call)
- Site check, one by one: `selection.ts` `"draw"` (`draw`, `timedDraw`), `game.ts` `"pick"`, `"replacement"` («Bájale», «Cambiazo», `replaceCurrent`, joker availability), `"swap_in"`; `rg "shuffle\("` over `engine/` for newer ones
- `lib/api.ts` throwaway `seededRng(0)` for the view''s joker trials: keep, comment stays true
- `game.ts` `countOf(save, data)`: `() => 0` when `data.demo`; every caller passes `data` (`draw`, `timedDraw`, «Bájale», «Cambiazo», `jokersView`, `replaceCurrent`, `outlook.ts` ×2); `see()` still writes seen rows
- Running-out notice (`decision 195: Supply notice: bundles running out instead of exhausted subcategories`): empty by itself with counts 0; confirm, no extra code
- Full game unchanged; `engine/fixtures/` tapes untouched and passing
- Scan `rg "\.seen\b|countOf"` over `app/client/src` for other seen-based displays (stats, players screen, achievements): list them in the done note; one visible in the demo → `pm task add 175 …` follow-up
- One lasting test (`engine/demo.test.ts` or in `game.test.ts`, fixture pool, `data.demo` true): scripted solo game (picks, answers, «Bájale», «Cambiazo», «Paso») and a few timed rounds, run twice on fresh saves → identical `offered`, `current`, `answers`; a second game on the first''s save → the first''s questions; `data.demo` false → two `actionRng` differ. No other new tests
- Docs: `plans/12-client-engine.md`, `plans/03-game-flow.md` (selection, rng): one "Demo" bullet naming decision 340 and counts off; `plans/decisions.md` D-58 note if needed; `rg` old names after renames (decision 200)

Done when: `TRIVIA_DEMO=1 npm run dev -w app/client`, two games with the same choice show the same cards (by hand); `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-17T13:32:07Z', '2026-10-18T00:10:33Z', 1548, 0, 'opus', 'app');
