- Games counted in a `demo` tally beside `mods` (`"games": {…, "mods": {}, …}`); stats files from before default to 0 (`decision 119: Telemetry recording: derived from the save into a per-install side file`)
- `qgen report` played output: name the demo count wherever it shows `mods`''s
- Check with a hand-made stats input (throw-away, deleted after)

Done when: a demo session''s answers are absent from calibration and counted under `demo`; `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-17T13:32:13Z', '2026-10-18T00:10:49Z', 1548, 0, NULL, 'app');
