- Review sets (`decision 352: Gallery reviews: a review set of the touched shots, linked as /gallery?set=<name>`, built in `task 1581: Gallery review sets: /gallery?set=<name>, only the shots a change touched, linked from the review decision`): `--demo --set task-1555 --only …` writes `work/gallery-demo/sets/` today; `/gallery?demo&set=<name>` reads it
