Done when: both resolutions in all four locales are in `work/gallery-demo/`, `/gallery?demo&set=task-1555` shows them, the review decision is raised; `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-17T13:34:08Z', '2026-10-18T00:28:00Z', 1551, 0, NULL, 'app');
