INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1630, 184, 'End-to-end check on a throw-away theme bundle', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-21, authoring/tools/qgen.py (qgen taxonomy/remap: proposal paths via rekey.rel, no crash when TRIVIA_WORK is outside the repo). Chain passed on a temp clone (theme bundle astro): bundle new --kind theme (2000 target, languages [en]); taxonomy → 9 categories, 55 subcategories, 52 with base_related, --apply wrote categories, names, base-related.json; batch --bundle astro (2 subcategories × 4 slots, slots patched in the clone only): 6 drafts, 4 merged, 4 approved, 2 dropped against base (overlap q-1632, duplicate q-4831); translate es/es-ES/de (4 each, all approved); export wrote bundles/astro/pool.json, pool.{en,es-ES,de}.json; validate: only failures already in the trunk (demo.json, q-0110/q-1692 translations) plus the missing en/de bundle name, which plan 186''s row setup adds by hand; report --bundle astro shows supply and the four-locale draft gap; --cost (text, --json) shows astro × es, es-ES, en, de. Throw-away probe: draw_slots already_asked and rate_candidates include base questions (decision 350), no change needed. Follow-up: task 1674 (duplicates() false positive on generic answers + essential photo). claude: taxonomy opus 1 call $0.73 (crashed after it, fixed) + names sonnet 1 $0.05; batch 21 calls (opus 18, sonnet 3) 412k tok $2.67; tr-es 16 calls $1.12; tr-es-ES 13 calls $0.90; tr-de 13 calls $0.92; total 65 calls, $6.39. Scratch clone deleted, no traces. npm test, npm run build pass; npm run check fails only on the existing knip electron-builder finding; qgen validate fails only on the existing trunk data findings above.', 'Item 6 of `plan 184: Pipeline for topic bundles`; runs after every other code task of this plan (theme taxonomy and its apply, targets, gap aiming, overlap, cost). Waits on the decision "Theme taxonomy prompt: apply?".

- Scratch copy of the repo data: no commit, no symlinked `work/` (`QGEN_WORK` or a temp checkout, whichever the code supports).
- Chain: `qgen bundle new <x> --kind theme`; `qgen taxonomy --bundle <x>` + `--apply`; small `qgen batch --bundle <x>` (few subcategories × few slots); `qgen batch --translate es|es-ES|de --bundle <x>`; `qgen export` writes `app/data/bundles/<x>/pool.json` and `pool.{es-ES,en,de}.json`; `qgen validate` clean; `qgen report --bundle <x>` and `--cost` show it.
- Throw-away script: `draw_slots` probe and `rate`''s `overlap_candidates` see base questions for <x>''s concepts (decision 350: Overlap rate in drafting: which changes?); fix only if they don''t.
- Report claude calls and totals (decision 208: What must a script that calls claude report to its caller?) in the done note.
- Each failure: fix here if small, else a follow-up task in this plan.
- Remove every trace of <x> afterwards (`git status` clean apart from fixes).

Done when: chain passes, traces gone, fixes staged; `npm run check`, `npm test`, `npm run build`, `qgen validate` pass.', '2026-10-21T20:23:37Z', '2026-10-21T22:16:38Z', 1621, 0, 'opus', 'questions');
