Do, in 17a "Free DLC":
- One block per bundle (`### \`stem\` (<en name>)` …): name (= in-game name, decision 50 item 3), short description (≤ 300 chars), "About This Content" in en, es, de; es-ES only where it differs from es.
- Content per 17a''s fields: free, needs the base game, optional install, off by default (switched on in the question bundle step), plays alone or with the base questions, grows with updates; its achievement only if `decision 368: Achievements for the topic bundles: one per bundle like the regional ones?` is answered yes (pending: leave it out, note it in the decision); no question count.
