Decision: `pm decision add "DLC store texts approved? (topic bundles)"` with `--intro`, pattern of `decision 173: DLC store texts approved? (colombia)` (body: where the text is, which languages, achievement mentioned or not); options `Approved as drafted` (recommended), `Approved with fixes (list them)`. Then close this task; fixes on the answer go into a follow-up task of this plan, added by whoever reads the answer (say so in the decision body).', '2026-10-21T20:28:11Z', '2026-10-21T23:03:04Z', 1642, 0, NULL, 'questions');
