- `pm decision add "Topic DLC capsules approved?"` with `--intro`, listing `authoring/store/out/capsules/dlc-<id>/` (and the `stem` icon variant''s path); options `Approved as rendered (text only)` (recommended), `Approved with the bundle icon`, `Fixes (say which)`. Then close this task; an icon or fixes answer → a follow-up task of this plan, added by whoever reads the answer (say so in the body).', '2026-10-21T20:28:11Z', '2026-10-21T23:03:55Z', 1642, 0, NULL, 'questions');
