- Options: `entered: <id> app … depot …, …` (recommended), `not yet`, `issues (rows)`.
- `pm task-pending-decision 1658 $did`; done.', '2026-10-21T20:28:12Z', NULL, 1642, 0, NULL, 'questions');
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1658, 187, 'Record the topic DLC IDs', 'work', 'open', NULL, NULL, '`plan 187: Steam DLC and store for the topic bundles` task 7: record what the developer entered in Steamworks for the topic DLCs. Pending on the checklist decision of `task 1657: Topic DLCs entered in Steamworks? (checklist decision)`; pattern: the regional record tasks (`pm decision list --answered --grep "entered in Steamworks"`).

