INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web, model, worktree) VALUES (1781, 188, 'run tr-es-<n> (stem)', 'work', 'done', -120, '2026-10-28, Done: tr-es-13: 300 translated, 299 approved, 1 need work, 0 not travelling (35m23s). claude: 481 calls, $27.23 ($0.08 per approved). report authoring/reports/tr-es-13.md; audit agreement 60/60 (100 %), 0 rejected; es added to stem languages, validate OK; es 299/2000, 17 en sources left untranslated (<50): no next run; files: questions.es.json, bundles/stem/pool.json, bundles.json, plans/22-bundles.md', 'Part of `plan 188: Content runs for the topic bundles` (milestone 19), bundle `stem`, added by `task 1677: QC batch-26 (stem)`. Translation run into es from the approved en sources.

## Steps
- `nix develop -c qgen batch --translate es --bundle stem` (`authoring/RUNBOOK.md` steps 1–5).
- After the run rename this task to the run name `qgen` printed (`pm task set`; may fail while running: then note it).
- Note: the "Done:" line, report path, and from `authoring/reports/<run>.md` and `qgen report --cost`: selected, translated, approved, needs_work, rejected, not travelling, $ per approved translation, audit agreement. No spot check, no QC task, no `qgen health ack`. needs_work: nothing.
- If the export wrote `app/data/bundles/stem/pool.es.json` and es isn''t in `stem`''s `languages` (`app/data/bundles.json`): add it (row edit only), `qgen validate` clean, stage the file.
- `qgen report --bundle stem --locale es` at 2000 → no next run; else ≥ 50 approved en sources not yet in es → add `run tr-es-<n+1> (stem)` (same body, one open run per locale); fewer → nothing.
- Add a progress line (approved per locale) for `stem` in `plans/22-bundles.md`; all four locales at 2000 → `stem` done there.

## pm-run rules (plan 84, plan 17 "Batch tasks under pm run")
- D-36: no prompt, pool, media or `qgen.py` changes; findings become decisions or tasks in their own plans. Only exception: a locale joining `stem`''s `languages` row.
- `tasks.sql` alone isn''t a dirty tree. Stage exactly the `git add` paths the command prints (plus `app/data/bundles.json` after a `languages` edit); don''t commit.
- Exit 75, exit 2, any other non-zero code, or exit 1 three times at one step → `pm decision add "Continue <run> (stem)…?"` with the last 30 lines of output, `pm task-pending-decision <this task> <id>`, stage nothing, stop.', '2026-10-28T23:09:02Z', '2026-10-28T23:46:13Z', 1677, 0, NULL, 'questions');
