-      "rule": "Answering needs a connection to Colombia: Colombian places, food, customs, festivals, people, music, sport, words, sayings or history that the players outside Colombia mostly wouldn''t know."
+      "rule": "Answering needs a connection to Colombia: Colombian places, food, customs, festivals, people, music, sport, words, sayings or history that the players outside Colombia mostly wouldn''t know.",
