- Hover/click a text box: catalog key and text; flag a string with a note (what''s wrong, the wording you want)
- Guide for the wording: `app/client/src/locales/style/en.md`
- Answer when done; the fix task (`Gallery fixes from the review flags`) waits for all four languages', '', 'reviewed, flags in /gallery', NULL, '2026-10-14T16:25:23Z', '2026-10-15T01:35:01Z', 804, NULL, 'once', NULL, '2026-10-15, task 1026: 2026-10-14, task 1026: 8 en flags: flag.* «mark» → «flag» («Flag this question», «Flag», «Flagged questions»; on/off/titleOn/unflag/empty to match), flag.body «Optional: Tell us the issue» (placeholder «What''s wrong with it?»), overlay.goTo «Go to question» (no «…»); outlook.exhausted → task 1104: Supply notice: name the bundle running out, not exhausted subcategories; screen.question.finalWaiting → task 1105: Final answer wait: dramatic animation instead of «Final answer…». Guide en.md: glossary flag terms, «…» only for waiting states, no «?» in action dialog titles, bad patterns. All flags fixed_on 2026-10-14; plans/11-steam.md store how-to text follows.');
