- `nature` Nature of the United States (4, general)
  - `wildlife` American wildlife
  - `plants-and-trees` American plants and trees
  - `national-parks` National parks
  - `weather-and-seasons` American weather and seasons
- `history` History of the United States (5, general)
  - `native-nations` Native American nations
  - `colonies-and-founding` Colonies and the founding
  - `nineteenth-century` Westward expansion and the Civil War
  - `twentieth-century` 20th-century America
  - `civics` Government and civics
- `people` People of the United States (2, general)
  - `inventors-and-founders` American inventors and business founders
  - `trailblazers` American trailblazers
- `food-and-drink` American food and drink (5, general)
  - `regional-dishes` Regional American dishes
