Look: `git show pm/task-1523-run-1569-left`. Keep: `git merge pm/task-1523-run-1569-left`. Then `git branch -D pm/task-1523-run-1569-left`.', 'A piece of automated work finished but left changes behind that it didn''t hand in. They were set aside, nothing is lost. Decide whether to keep them or throw them away.', 'Discard: batch-10 column of batches.md; replaced by a fresh qgen batch-report commit (also fills batch-10 days), branch deleted', NULL, '2026-10-17T13:11:34Z', '2026-10-17T14:12:25Z', NULL, NULL, 'once', NULL, '');
